o focus on operational efficiency including our restructuring actions, hiring freeze, and tighter control of discretionary spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/02/uipath-path-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2023 Q3","e":"path","d":"2022-12-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"So, the restructuring was that we announced two weeks ago, I think.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/02/uipath-path-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2023 Q4","e":"path","d":"2023-03-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"We have made significant investment in AI for years, and from inception, it has been infused into every part of our platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/15/uipath-path-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2023 Q4","e":"path","d":"2023-03-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"We have been one of the first company to invest in task mining, and this is one of the most ambitious AI project that we have ever attempted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/15/uipath-path-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2023 Q4","e":"path","d":"2023-03-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"Executing a restructuring, driving efficiencies, and streamlining our organization has increased our focus, enhanced business agility, and leaves us well positioned to continue to expand our market share and leadership in automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/15/uipath-path-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2023 Q4","e":"path","d":"2023-03-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"As Rob said, our results reflect the positive impact of our restructuring efforts, combined with a continued focus on discretionary cost management and resource allocation that prioritizes higher-return initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/15/uipath-path-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q1","e":"path","d":"2023-05-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"One of our biggest competitive advantages in leveraging the power of generative AI is our longtime investment in AI Computer Vision.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/24/uipath-path-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q1","e":"path","d":"2023-05-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"And U.S. Silica, which started their UiPath journey with Test Suite, expanded to additional platform capabilities as they look to improve cost savings, productivity, and employee and customer experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/24/uipath-path-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q1","e":"path","d":"2023-05-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"Another great example is Hyundai Capital, which is innovating the car buying experience for Genesis, Hyundai, and Kia dealerships and their customers by leveraging Document Understanding to streamline the loan and lease process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/24/uipath-path-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q2","e":"path","d":"2023-09-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"Inside that number, there are more than 300 specific to AI, which we expect will grow as we continue to invest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/09/06/uipath-path-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q2","e":"path","d":"2023-09-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Raimo Lenschow","x":"Like how does it play out for you and how are you competing for budget dollars in this sort of environment where you know you need to spend more on AI, but you know the money needs to come from somewhere and how does it fit to like overall spending?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/09/06/uipath-path-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q2","e":"path","d":"2023-09-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"A great example is a Fortune 500 oil producer and a UiPath customer since 2018 with over $10 million in cost savings to date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/09/06/uipath-path-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q2","e":"path","d":"2023-09-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"It's about document understanding, communication mining, task mining, the moat that makes a difference, and infusing our gen AI capabilities, which are actually a visual for our customers to see on how that benefits them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/09/06/uipath-path-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q2","e":"path","d":"2023-09-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"So, I think that long term -- mid to long term, the creator gen AI will be basically commoditized and the essence would be that the best platform is going to win, even with better chances in the market because the adoption will be also democratized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/09/06/uipath-path-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q3","e":"path","d":"2023-11-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"You know, what I would say is that when customers are looking at spending with us and the AI, the AI story and AI connection, AI to automation connection really fits well to where customers want to invest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/01/uipath-path-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q3","e":"path","d":"2023-11-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"Customers standardize on our AI-powered automation platform to deliver transformational outcomes that streamline processes, eliminate errors, and operate with enterprise-quality execution needed to succeed in today's environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/01/uipath-path-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q3","e":"path","d":"2023-11-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"During the quarter, they expanded to the full platform as they look to harness AI and integrate Document Understanding, Process Mining, and Communications Mining into their automation program to improve citizen services, drive operational efficiencies, and increase cost saving and capacity creation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/01/uipath-path-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q4","e":"path","d":"2024-03-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"We believe there is tremendous opportunity in front of us, and we plan to continue to make strategic investments in technology, like IDP and generative AI, as well as our go-to-market resources to help capture this large and growing market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/13/uipath-path-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q4","e":"path","d":"2024-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"Our unique approach combines our specialized AI and more than 70 pre-trained models and verticalized packaged solutions to help customers streamline processes, identify continuous process improvements, and rapidly scale their Document Understanding projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/13/uipath-path-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2024 Q4","e":"path","d":"2024-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Enslin","x":"The five-year base period agreement will streamline the acquisition process and reduce cost of delivery of UiPath products and services to the DOD, Department of Defense, Intelligence Community, and the U.S. Coast Guard.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/13/uipath-path-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q1","e":"path","d":"2024-05-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"And they were driven largely by our investments in AI, particularly in IDP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/29/uipath-path-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q1","e":"path","d":"2024-05-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Shell McMeans","x":"Can you speak to the investment in HAI and how does that play into your overall AI strategy?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/29/uipath-path-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q2","e":"path","d":"2024-09-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"At the same time, what I can say is we're investing in the platform, and we'll continue to invest in the platform and our AI capabilities because we see it as a meaningful opportunity to drive value and differentiation with customers, which, in our minds, reflects on the conviction that we have…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/05/uipath-path-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q2","e":"path","d":"2024-09-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"But long term, we feel very good about what AI is bringing, and we're investing because we do believe it has a meaningful ROI and reinforces the durability of our growth rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/05/uipath-path-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q2","e":"path","d":"2024-09-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"On our first-quarter earnings call, we discussed our commitment to improving execution and streamlining the organization, driving a deeper strategy around our growth products, continuing to enhance our relationships with meaningful partners and becoming a more customer-centric organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/05/uipath-path-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q2","e":"path","d":"2024-09-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"During the quarter, we made the difficult decision to reduce our workforce, streamlining the organization and driving further operational efficiencies while better prioritizing our go-to-market investments and continued focus on innovation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/05/uipath-path-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q3","e":"path","d":"2024-12-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"So, far, the company has realized cost savings of well over EUR 10 million per year and increased customer satisfaction to its online portal and financial services business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/05/uipath-path-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q3","e":"path","d":"2024-12-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"They expect to see significant cost savings from eliminating manual testing with additional improvements in employee engagement and experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/05/uipath-path-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q3","e":"path","d":"2024-12-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"This is on the top of an RPA market, inclusive of IDP and test automation that is growing at a double-digit rate, thanks to the tailwinds and disruption of GenAI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/05/uipath-path-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q4","e":"path","d":"2025-03-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Arti Vula","x":"…in the market, you know, out there kind of probably putting a damper on customer willingness to invest in new technologies and one could extrapolate that to AI, but do you think this incremental uncertainty is kind of going to make customers a little bit less reluctant to invest in new…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q4","e":"path","d":"2025-03-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"As we move forward, as Daniel has said, innovation is our No. 1 priority, and we will continue to invest in driving AI and agentic while delivering margin expansion through more disciplined expense management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q4","e":"path","d":"2025-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"We have also made strong progress executing against the priorities we laid out last year and are on track to complete our go-to-market changes and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q4","e":"path","d":"2025-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"Hundreds of customers are testing use cases that span evolving -- resolving vendor disputes, processing claims, streamlining sales operations, fraud detection and compliance, customer complaints, coordination of benefits, optimizing revenue cycle management, and improving logistics operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2025 Q4","e":"path","d":"2025-03-12","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"Launched into general availability today, Agentic Testing is a good example of specialized agentic solution that is disrupting the legacy application testing market by augmenting testers with AI agents for greater productivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q2","e":"path","d":"2025-09-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"You kind of hear different things as companies are responding to different areas, whether that be tariffs or interest rates or geopolitical items.","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/15998/webcast_transcript/UiPath+2Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q2","e":"path","d":"2025-09-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"From there, they plan to extend into other departments to deliver cost savings, higher customer satisfaction and greater efficiency.","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/15998/webcast_transcript/UiPath+2Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q2","e":"path","d":"2025-09-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"A great example is the leading US healthcare provider that is piloting our agentic products to streamline their accounts payable process.","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/15998/webcast_transcript/UiPath+2Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q2","e":"path","d":"2025-09-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"Turning to the specifics of our guide, we are raising guidance for the progress we've made on our operating priorities and the incremental FX tailwind since we provided guidance on our first quarter earnings call.","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/15998/webcast_transcript/UiPath+2Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q3","e":"path","d":"2025-12-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Lountzis","x":"You guys have driven some pretty meaningful OpEx leverage throughout this year and I'm just curious if you could provide any additional details around how you're thinking about OpEx investment next year to kind of support this AI product rollout and just broader monetization path.","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/17724/webcast_transcript/UiPath+3Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q3","e":"path","d":"2025-12-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"…now in terms of if you look at our sales stability, six months, nine months after kind of the restructuring that we had completed at the beginning of the year, as well as just a little bit of a normalization around areas like the public sector, which we've said is kind of back to a new…","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/17724/webcast_transcript/UiPath+3Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q3","e":"path","d":"2025-12-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"Turning to the specifics of our guide, despite the incremental FX headwind from the yen, we are raising guidance for the progress we've made on our operating priorities and the strength we are seeing in the business.","url":"https://d1io3yog0oux5.cloudfront.net/_46526bcdf4308aaf2bbcc2e9c5fdb9f4/uipath/db/1195/17724/webcast_transcript/UiPath+3Q+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q4","e":"path","d":"2026-03-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"But the number I keep coming back to is this, the number of customers above $100,000 in ARR who have bought AI products grew 25% year-over-year and they spend nearly 3x as much as those who have not.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q4","e":"path","d":"2026-03-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Dines","x":"With UiPath, they expect roughly $20 million in cost savings this year as they plan to further leverage the platform to support their broader transformation programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2026 Q4","e":"path","d":"2026-03-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"Across engineering, support and internal operations, we are deploying UiPath agents to streamline workflows, reduce manual work and accelerate execution, and we are already seeing productivity gains from these deployments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/uipath-path-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2027 Q1","e":"path","d":"2026-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Solomon Dines","x":"And the Fortune 500 energy company placed UiPath at the center of a $70 million cost reduction initiative made possible by our ability to bring deterministic, agentic, and process orchestration together as a single class platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/28/uipath-path-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2027 Q1","e":"path","d":"2026-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Solomon Dines","x":"With nearly 2,000 processes already automated and over $30 million in annual cost savings They are now expanding their deterministic base further and moving into agentic workflows building a pipeline of more than 200 additional deterministic automations and over 20 agentic use cases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/28/uipath-path-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2027 Q1","e":"path","d":"2026-05-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ashim Gupta","x":"Despite the incremental FX headwind, we are raising guidance for the progress we have made on our operating priorities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/28/uipath-path-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2027 Q1","e":"path","d":"2026-05-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Solomon Dines","x":"And to kinda continue on, it sounds like AI agents are, you know, largely extending, not replacing deterministic automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/28/uipath-path-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PATH 2027 Q1","e":"path","d":"2026-05-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Solomon Dines","x":"…we think about that, I wanted to ask is there any sort of dynamic where you are seeing customers leverage Agencik AI to somewhat cannibalize some of the traditional bot monetization, or is it largely building incremental automation and therefore incremental monetization on top of those workflows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/28/uipath-path-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[46,1,8777,0,0,0,7025,1279],[47,1,8604,0,0,0,6685,1350],[48,1,9281,0,0,0,7102,1675],[49,1,7377,0,0,0,5445,1400],[50,1,8868,0,0,0,6762,1654],[51,1,8673,0,0,0,6162,1776],[52,1,8563,0,0,0,6994,930],[53,1,8226,0,0,0,7055,687],[54,1,8124,0,0,0,6298,1266],[55,1,8678,0,0,0,6566,1431],[56,1,9108,0,0,0,7356,1258],[57,1,7976,0,0,0,6848,634],[58,1,7255,0,0,0,5920,965],[59,1,7296,0,0,0,5612,1233],[60,1,8010,0,0,0,4071,3545],[62,1,8056,0,0,0,5841,1463],[63,1,8070,0,0,0,6092,1110],[64,1,8994,0,0,0,6742,1443],[65,1,8377,0,0,0,3273,3898],[66,1,7718,0,0,0,5866,1518]],"cinema":[[46,1,8777,0,0,0,7025,1279],[47,1,8604,0,0,0,6685,1350],[48,1,9281,0,0,0,7102,1675],[49,1,7377,0,0,0,5445,1400],[50,1,8868,0,0,0,6762,1654],[51,1,8673,0,0,0,6162,1776],[52,1,8563,0,0,0,6994,930],[53,1,8226,0,0,0,7055,687],[54,1,8124,0,0,0,6298,1266],[55,1,8678,0,0,0,6566,1431],[56,1,9108,0,0,0,7356,1258],[57,1,7976,0,0,0,6848,634],[58,1,7255,0,0,0,5920,965],[59,1,7296,0,0,0,5612,1233],[60,1,8010,0,0,0,4071,3545],[62,1,8056,0,0,0,5841,1463],[63,1,8070,0,0,0,6092,1110],[64,1,8994,0,0,0,6742,1443],[65,1,8377,0,0,0,3273,3898],[66,1,7718,0,0,0,5866,1518]],"imax":[[46,1,8777,0,0,0,7025,1279],[47,1,8604,0,0,0,6685,1350],[48,1,9281,0,0,0,7102,1675],[49,1,7377,0,0,0,5445,1400],[50,1,8868,0,0,0,6762,1654],[51,1,8673,0,0,0,6162,1776],[52,1,8563,0,0,0,6994,93